  "worked_solution": "Pre-multiplying a vector $x\\in {R}^{5}$ by $A$ gives a linear combination of the columns of $A:$\n\n$$\n{{[\\begin{aligned}| & | & | & | & | \\\\ {a}_{1} & {a}_{2} & {a}_{3} & {a}_{4} & {a}_{5} \\\\ | & | & | & | & |\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{A}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{4} \\\\ {x}_{5}\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{x}={x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{1} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{2} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{3} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{4}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{4} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{5}[\\begin{aligned}| \\\\ {a}_{5} \\\\ |\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the image of ${R}^{5}$ under the action of $A$ must be $\\text{Col}(A),$ the column space of $A.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
